 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "This week,",
   "s": 0.124,
   "e": 0.694
  },
  {
   "text": "one game made almost four billion dollars.",
   "s": 0.902,
   "e": 3.647
  },
  {
   "text": "In one day.",
   "s": 3.834,
   "e": 4.537
  },
  {
   "text": "Grand Theft Auto Six.",
   "s": 5.026,
   "e": 6.362
  },
  {
   "text": "More than the entire box office of the biggest superhero movie ever.",
   "s": 6.707,
   "e": 10.32
  },
  {
   "text": "It reportedly cost over a billion dollars to make.",
   "s": 10.68,
   "e": 13.372
  },
  {
   "text": "But one of the first video games ever cost almost nothing.",
   "s": 13.842,
   "e": 16.595
  },
  {
   "text": "It was built in two weeks.",
   "s": 16.96,
   "e": 17.997
  },
  {
   "text": "By one scientist.",
   "s": 18.262,
   "e": 19.241
  },
  {
   "text": "To cure boredom.",
   "s": 19.376,
   "e": 20.555
  },
  {
   "text": "And yes,",
   "s": 20.879,
   "e": 21.546
  },
  {
   "text": "people still argue whether it was really the first.",
   "s": 21.741,
   "e": 24.19
  },
  {
   "text": "New York, nineteen fifty-eight. A nuclear lab held a visitors' day.",
   "s": 24.973,
   "e": 28.367
  },
  {
   "text": "The exhibits were dull.",
   "s": 28.965,
   "e": 29.837
  },
  {
   "text": "Photos.",
   "s": 30.344,
   "e": 31.067
  },
  {
   "text": "Charts.",
   "s": 31.211,
   "e": 31.713
  },
  {
   "text": "Humming machines.",
   "s": 32.155,
   "e": 32.772
  },
  {
   "text": "So physicist William Higinbotham grabbed a spare computer and an oscilloscope.",
   "s": 33.203,
   "e": 36.922
  },
  {
   "text": "Tennis.",
   "s": 37.249,
   "e": 37.742
  },
  {
   "text": "On a screen five inches wide.",
   "s": 37.932,
   "e": 39.967
  },
  {
   "text": "The net was a line.",
   "s": 40.289,
   "e": 40.933
  },
  {
   "text": "The ball was a glowing dot.",
   "s": 41.347,
   "e": 42.346
  },
  {
   "text": "Two aluminum boxes.",
   "s": 42.927,
   "e": 43.962
  },
  {
   "text": "One knob, one button.",
   "s": 44.137,
   "e": 45.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Hundreds of visitors lined up to play.",
   "s": 45.744,
   "e": 47.619
  },
  {
   "text": "The next year, you could even play tennis on the Moon.",
   "s": 47.971,
   "e": 49.98
  },
  {
   "text": "Or on Jupiter.",
   "s": 50.212,
   "e": 51.002
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the lab took it apart for the parts.",
   "s": 51.682,
   "e": 53.189
  },
  {
   "text": "He had patented twenty inventions.",
   "s": 53.65,
   "e": 55.455
  },
  {
   "text": "This one?",
   "s": 55.786,
   "e": 56.119
  },
  {
   "text": "He never bothered.",
   "s": 56.551,
   "e": 57.328
  },
  {
   "text": "He thought it was too simple.",
   "s": 57.706,
   "e": 58.558
  },
  {
   "text": "Sixty-eight years later,",
   "s": 59.169,
   "e": 60.644
  },
  {
   "text": "that dot became a whole city.",
   "s": 60.912,
   "e": 62.602
  },
  {
   "text": "Those two buttons became a controller.",
   "s": 62.992,
   "e": 64.595
  },
  {
   "text": "And the line of visitors?",
   "s": 64.999,
   "e": 65.988
  },
  {
   "text": "Now it's thirty-two million pre-orders.",
   "s": 66.322,
   "e": 68.239
  },
  {
   "text": "We still line up to play.",
   "s": 68.701,
   "e": 69.697
  },
  {
   "text": "So what was the first game you ever played?",
   "s": 70.325,
   "e": 71.715
  }
 ]
